<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36943" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαρτ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>complete, finish,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἡμέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					21.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>finish</i> a building, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(2).538
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Mytilene</span>); [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιβλία</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				296.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόδες</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραπέζης</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἕως τῶν κάτω τελέως -ισμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					3.6.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>equip and dispatch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάφας εἰς . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Peripl.M.Rubr.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῖα, γένη,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>; simply, <i>equip,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς -ισμένας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					19.77
				</span></i>
			; <i>furnish, supply,</i> Wilcken <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				176.10
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηρτισμένον ἅπασι</span>”
				<i>completely furnished,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					PAmh.
					2.93.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς πᾶν ἔργον ἀγαθὸν ἐξηρτισμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Ti.</u>
					3.17
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i>provide oneself with,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄλλα ἐξήρτιστο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					1.33
				</span></i>
			.</div>
